<title>POLAND: PLI NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 30,000.</title>
<headline>PLI NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 30,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.03 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.05 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.13 vs   0.01 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    4.08 vs   3.26</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.89 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.02 vs   0.60</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.71 vs   0.53 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   35.48 vs  19.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Polish Life</p>
<p>Improvement SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
